`PageTemplates`, in pseudo-IDL:

```typescript
{
  coverPage?: string
  // Available variables: all Composition preamble variables + {{asset:*}}
  // {{heading-1}} is available here only (resolves via Composition.depthOffset).

  pageHeader?: string
  // Available: {{page-number}}, {{asset:*}}

  pageFooter?: string
  // Available: {{page-number}}, {{asset:*}}
}
```
